# Subscription OAuth token for the Claude Code CLI (not an API key).
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# Optional. A Discord incoming webhook on a FORUM channel, which turns on the Discord
# run surface for local `implement-spec` runs (ADR-0012): one thread per run, carrying
# run started / slice building / slice merged / halt / complete. Unset, the surface is
# a silent no-op — nothing is emitted and nothing is warned about.
#
# It must be a forum (or media) channel: an incoming webhook can only create a thread
# where `thread_name` is accepted, and there is no way to look one up by name. Pointed
# at an ordinary text channel it creates nothing and every preview reports `off`.
#
# This is a CREDENTIAL — anyone holding the URL can post to that channel, and it cannot
# be rotated in place (there is no reset-token endpoint; rotation is delete-and-create).
# It belongs here, in the gitignored `.env`, never in the committed `config.json`.
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=
